= Feliks Perl

Perl represents Centrum PPS and concentrates on the party line and socialist press.

- @define_party_line
- @direct_party_press
- @root: Return to main

@define_party_line
title: Define Party Line
subtitle: Strengthen the position and cohesion of Centrum PPS.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; centrum_strength += 5; centrum_dissent -= 5

Perl sets out a clearer political line for Centrum PPS.

@direct_party_press
title: Direct Party Press
subtitle: Make the Media card available immediately.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; media_timer = 0; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: media

Perl turns the leadership's attention to „Robotnik” and the wider PPS press. The underlying media choices remain part of the temporary inherited card system.
